      "title": "eClinicalWorks vs Epic: A 2026 EHR Comparison for Healthcare Decision-Makers | TransMedex",
      "description": "eClinicalWorks vs Epic compared on pricing, market share, interoperability, output, and which one your specialty and facility type need.",
